' WOLF1.BAS - the shareware build of the QB64 Wolfenstein 3-D port (*.WL1 data files)
' Build it with: qb64 -x WOLF1.BAS (WOLF3D.BAS builds the full version, *.WL6)
'
' Like WOLF1VER.H, the version header of the original shareware build:
' UPLOAD is the shareware game (episode 1 only), and APOGEE_1_0 the v1.0 shareware
' data of May 1992 (see VERSION.BI)
$Let UPLOAD = 1
$Let APOGEE_1_0 = 1
'$INCLUDE:'WOLF3D.BAS'
